  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Uganda-Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve the position for coffee farmers and workers in Uganda by promoting an innovative and inclusive private sector that sources and trades coffee transparently and responsibly. It will contribute to an enhanced regulatory framework that supports effective, transparent, inclusive and sustainable trade, and ensure implementation and monitoring of recommended policies and mechanisms that support inclusive and sustainable trade by a strong and vibrant civil society. This will be done through advocacy and inclusive dialogue to create an enabling policy and regulatory environment and frameworks that enhance the sustainable use of natural resources, fair value distribution, sustainable consumption while strengthening farmers and workers organizations while including men, women and the youth in decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
